{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/3656","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/3656/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/3656/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/3656/events","html_url":"https://github.com/yetone/magpie/issues/3656","id":6031455694,"node_id":"I_kwDOUns_9M8AAAABZ4C1zg","number":3656,"title":"[Bug] 账号打码遮蔽自定义别名，并误遮蔽套餐名称","user":{"login":"faketrader","id":9635792,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2MzU3OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9635792?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/faketrader","html_url":"https://github.com/faketrader","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faketrader/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faketrader/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faketrader/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faketrader/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faketrader/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faketrader/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faketrader/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faketrader/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faketrader/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-26T01:05:44Z","updated_at":"2026-10-26T05:02:00Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 问题描述\n\n开启「账号打码」后，自定义账号别名也被遮蔽，多个账号难以区分；同时，套餐名称中的非账号文字也出现误遮蔽。\n\n实际观察：\n- 用量页中，自定义账号别名被打码。\n- Antigravity 在用量页和供应商页显示的套餐名称 `Google AI Pro` 中，`Google` 被打码。\n\n## 复现步骤\n\n1. 为供应商账号设置自定义别名。\n2. 开启「账号打码」。\n3. 查看用量页中的账号别名，以及用量页和供应商页中的 Antigravity 套餐名称。\n\n## 期望行为\n\n- 邮箱、手机号等原始账号信息按设置打码。\n- 用户设置的自定义账号别名保持可见，方便辨认账号。\n- 供应商品牌、套餐名称和模型名称正常显示。\n\n## 源码线索\n\n核查 main 时，`internal/gui/assets/app.js` 的 `noteAccounts()` 会将 `alias` 收集为账号名称，`names()` 也会收集 `accountNames` 中的自定义名称。随后打码逻辑通过 `TreeWalker` 扫描整个 body 的文本，并处理 `title` 属性，按字符串匹配进行遮蔽。\n\n这能解释自定义别名被主动打码。套餐文字误遮蔽可能由账号值与品牌文字同名触发；具体触发值尚未通过运行时数据确认。\n\n源码位置：https://github.com/yetone/magpie/blob/main/internal/gui/assets/app.js#L24687\n\n建议根据字段或元素明确限定打码范围，并区分原始账号身份信息、自定义展示别名与套餐文字，避免全页面同名文字被一起遮蔽。\n\n相关：#1515（账号别名）、#2462（路由页别名展示）。\n\n## 截图\n\n<img width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0ed4c76b-a199-48e2-82f3-292786d5e549\" />\n<img width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/514cbf4e-9bd4-4e43-b98a-6b090c43041a\" />","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/3656/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/3656/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}